{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411060/extras/f787eb3ac50652bc0d370a978d657b06.webp?t=1769579000\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411060/extras/f787eb3ac50652bc0d370a978d657b06.poster.avif?t=1769579000\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=230 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broomstick Exorcist is a supernatural Beat 'em up game set in a hand-drawn 2.5D manga-esque monochromatic world. In it, you fight various ghosts and demons inspired by Asian urban myths, immersing you in a world that feels like it's ripped straight from the pages of a black-and-white\u00a0manga.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Premise</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere in a corner of this world, spirits refuse to stay dead. Play as Vikka, an insomniac street sweeper who hunts demons at night with her trusty broomstick and supernatural skills. Upgrade your skills, chain your precise combos, and adapt to every battle. And when the battle peaks, Henshin! Embrace your Qareen and transform into the ultimate exorcist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Manga-Esque Visual Style</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411060/extras/107cf4db708b26af78104a3651679125.poster.avif?t=1769579000\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411060/extras/107cf4db708b26af78104a3651679125.webm?t=1769579000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn 2D sprites match the striking contrasts and depth of monochrome manga, setting the tone for a world caught between the mundane and the supernatural.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Supernaturally Quirky Foes</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411060/extras/c3d134156ebca01dc82624120eb72a5b.poster.avif?t=1769579000\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411060/extras/c3d134156ebca01dc82624120eb72a5b.webm?t=1769579000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411060/extras/c3d134156ebca01dc82624120eb72a5b.mp4?t=1769579000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From long-heads to the flying mistress and even little restless souls, each enemy you face is uniquely designed with charm and eerie humor, blending folklore and absurdity into every encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Broomstick Techniques &amp; Upgrades</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411060/extras/f9eeeab65b4620ca6c73edfca12f5f15.poster.avif?t=1769579000\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411060/extras/f9eeeab65b4620ca6c73edfca12f5f15.webm?t=1769579000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock upgradeable skill trees with passive boosts and flashy combo attacks. Customize Vikka\u2019s fighting style and exorcist techniques to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Transform: Unleash Your Other Self</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411060/extras/57069def6ca8c04cdbd79b86498e5efa.poster.avif?t=1769579000\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411060/extras/57069def6ca8c04cdbd79b86498e5efa.webm?t=1769579000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Channel Vikka\u2019s Qareen, a powerful spiritual double born of her other self and Henshin! Become stronger, faster, and fierce enough to turn the tide.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3411060?t=1769579000","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411060/6d51c9bdd360478e0209227102de38494c1b2a45/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769579000","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411060/e400692581be719d28485978aa683f530ad16a36/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769579000","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411060/e400692581be719d28485978aa683f530ad16a36/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769579000","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3875730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411060/extras/f787eb3ac50652bc0d